  "body": "<p><strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"245\">Many of you have wanted to find out more about Q-Guard</strong> &#8211; whether you missed out on the first webinars or would like to see the solution in action, <strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"401\">we&#8217;re offering you two new dates</strong> to discover (or rediscover) our test automation tool, <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"513\">developed entirely in Luxembourg</strong>.</p><p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">📅 </span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tuesday May 27</span></b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> (in French)</span> <br><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> 📅 </span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tuesday June 3 </span></b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">(in English)</span> <br><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> 🕚 </span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">At 11:00 am</span></b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> &#8211; Duration: 45 minutes</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}\"> </span></p><p data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"564\"><strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"564\">Why Q-Guard?</strong></p><p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"790\"><strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"577\">Q-Guard</strong> is Q-Leap&#8217;s test automation solution. It transforms the way you test, thanks to an innovative approach <strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"789\">based on the analysis of real user behavior</strong>. </p><p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"842\">Without writing a single line of code, you can :</p><p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">✅ </span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Reduce test creation time by up to 90%.</span></b> <br><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> ✅ </span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Intuitively automate key user paths</span></b> <br><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> ✅<strong> Perform</strong></span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">ests <br>&#8230;</span></b></p><p aria-level=\"3\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Register for free :</span></b><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"134245418\":true,\"134245529\":true,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":281,\"335559739\":281}\"> </span></p><p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">📌 </span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">French session &#8211; May 27, 2025 at 11:00 am</span></b> <br><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> 👉 </span><a href=\"https://q-leap.odoo.com/event/automatisez-vos-tests-selon-le-comportement-reel-des-utilisateurs-19/register\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Register here</span></a><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}\"> </span></p><p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">📌 </span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">English session &#8211; June 3, 2025 at 11:00 am</span></b> <br><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> 👉 </span><a href=\"https://q-leap.odoo.com/event/automatisez-vos-tests-selon-le-comportement-reel-des-utilisateurs-20/register\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Register here</span></a><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}\"> </span></p><p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Don&#8217;t miss this opportunity to discover how </span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Q-Guard can transform your quality strategy</span></b><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}\"> </span></p><p><span data-ccp-props=\"{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}\">See you soon at the webinar!  </span></p>",
